{"4796170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Lonely Golem", "steam_appid": 4796170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in the shadow of an ancient stone TOWER with no memory of how you got there. The MONKS say you have been asleep for centuries but they know not why. They also say the FOREST is slowly dying from a mysterious poison which seeps forth from the TOWER... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Not only is the FOREST dying but the seven realms are each being plagued by a different natural disaster. While you were sleeping the elements fell out of balance. It cannot be mere coincidence for you to awaken in this time of need.  You must traverse the seven realms in search of a way to stop the poison and restore balance. Perhaps you will find      an answer to your own mystery along the way... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore seven distinct realms (HILLS, TUNDRA, PLAINS, SWAMP, OCEAN, DESERT, VOLCANO)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through elemental FORTRESSES ruled by legendary beasts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn SPELLS, upgrade your FISTS, and obtain protective WARDS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate ancient RUINS and uncover lost knowledge </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect ingredients for brewing unique POTION recipes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become FRIENDS with local wildlife </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in the shadow of an ancient stone TOWER with no memory of how you got there. The MONKS say you have been asleep for centuries but they know not why. They also say the FOREST is slowly dying from a mysterious poison which seeps forth from the TOWER... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p